        "body": "Build the second dungeon one room at a time so each encounter can be played and tuned before the next one exists.\n\n## First slice\n\n- Add a three-room-intended dungeon to the splash, but author only room one for now.\n- Room one remixes two Wolf Woods threats: Snapjaw pressures the tank with a long wound while Skulker bursts the healer.\n- Start with Tank and the full Wolf Woods spell kit; this is a sequel encounter, not another tutorial.\n- Pin the intended balance shape: deliberate triage wins, Flash Heal spam loses.\n- Simulate across seeds and play it in the browser before adding room two.\n\nRoom two and room three are deliberately separate follow-ups after playtest.",
