        "created_at": "2026-07-31T19:21:37Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-07-31T19:21:37Z",
        "body": "Room one is now **Tumblewood Trail — Double Trouble**, shifting dungeon two toward a brighter, kid-friendly storybook tone.\n\nMeasured Snapjaw + Skulker across 100 seeds: Renew 100% win, triage 99%, Shield 98%, and panic 0%. Idle also loses 100%, so healing matters. Browser playtest: first attempt lost; second cleared in 48.0s with Tank and Player alive by keeping Renew rolling and shielding the healer before Ambush.\n\nLeaving this open for human playtest feedback before room two.",
